{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Orium",
    "steam_appid": 3316610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.poster.avif?t=1754849099\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.webm?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.mp4?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is dying out, galaxy by galaxy, but capitalism waits for no one. Aboard your spaceship, S-Corp expects you to increase its revenue by greedily exploiting every star system in your path. After all, just because the stars are fading away doesn\u2019t mean business has to stop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/6f94dff4a7f662294ec898c58e4f0038.avif?t=1754849099\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a procedurally generated galaxy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition takes place in a new galaxy, reactivate abandoned S-Corp beacons or travel through wormholes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit everything in your path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 30 days to complete your mission, so make the most of this precious time for our shareholders with your automated production factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.poster.avif?t=1754849099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.webm?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.mp4?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exterminate the scourge devouring the universe before it takes over you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elusive being is gradually taking over the galaxy, and you've got to carve your path by blasting its minions back to where they came from with your laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle makes you stronger, and your discoveries across the galaxy can influence your victory. And if you're running late, your best colleague Bogg is always here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/b1974a36b9cdd3c703f3bb1e8c3061be.avif?t=1754849099\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1 hour per expedition in a galaxy in decline\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of thousands of stars just waiting to be exploited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several captains and starting weapons to help you build a strategy\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of cosmic monsters to stop you in your tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades as you progress through battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative events to enhance your victory strategy</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.poster.avif?t=1754849099\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.webm?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.mp4?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is dying out, galaxy by galaxy, but capitalism waits for no one. Aboard your spaceship, S-Corp expects you to increase its revenue by greedily exploiting every star system in your path. After all, just because the stars are fading away doesn\u2019t mean business has to stop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/6f94dff4a7f662294ec898c58e4f0038.avif?t=1754849099\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a procedurally generated galaxy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition takes place in a new galaxy, reactivate abandoned S-Corp beacons or travel through wormholes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit everything in your path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 30 days to complete your mission, so make the most of this precious time for our shareholders with your automated production factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.poster.avif?t=1754849099\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.webm?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.mp4?t=1754849099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exterminate the scourge devouring the universe before it takes over you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elusive being is gradually taking over the galaxy, and you've got to carve your path by blasting its minions back to where they came from with your laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle makes you stronger, and your discoveries across the galaxy can influence your victory. And if you're running late, your best colleague Bogg is always here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/extras/b1974a36b9cdd3c703f3bb1e8c3061be.avif?t=1754849099\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1 hour per expedition in a galaxy in decline\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tens of thousands of stars just waiting to be exploited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several captains and starting weapons to help you build a strategy\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of cosmic monsters to stop you in your tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades as you progress through battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative events to enhance your victory strategy</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The galaxy is yours! Aboard your ship, exterminate your enemies, exploit planets and weave your enterprise across the stars to satisfy your employer. Orium is a space roguelite with 4X elements.",
